            @the84hz 
        </a> or say hello at 
           <a href="https://instagram.com/loopwithvijay" target="_blank">
            @loopwithvijay <br/> 
        </a>
      </div>
        <p class="closing">
        A thoughtful home for thinking in systems, Coming soon.
      </p>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>